# Version control and agent scratch. Nothing here reaches an image today only
# because worker.Dockerfile and datasets.Dockerfile COPY named paths rather than
# `COPY . .`; agent transcripts can contain credentials, so that selective COPY is
# load-bearing. Excluding them here makes it a property of the context instead.
# .git is safe to drop: the version is a static literal in pyproject.toml, there is
# no setuptools-scm, and worker.Dockerfile's `git` is apt-get installing the binary.
.git/
.dev/
.claude/
.svamp/
